   "text": "Stazione ferroviaria di Coimbatore: 51.2 km (circa 1 ora e mezza)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Kept '51.2' and the digit '1' verbatim per the numbers rule (previous rejection: number 1 missing)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4a050e2e591c2321213b",
   "sourceHash": "4a050e2e591c2321213b0cef7600fc62dca863202f3835f81c7b8893def9b8b2",
   "text": "Offrite servizi di trasporto?",
